    title: 'Missed Call Text Back: How to Recover Every Lost Lead Automatically',
    slug: { _type: 'slug', current: 'missed-call-text-back' },
    category: 'Lead Recovery',
    readTime: '5 min',
    excerpt: 'Every missed call is a missed sale. Without an instant follow-up, that caller hangs up and calls your competitor within minutes. Here\'s how to set up GoHighLevel\'s missed call text back feature.',
    publishedAt: '2026-05-18T00:00:00Z',
    author: 'GHL Service Provider',
        seo: { metaTitle: 'Missed Call Text Back: How to Recover Every Lost Lead Automatically', metaDescription: 'Every missed call is a missed sale. Set up GoHighLevel missed call text back to instantly follow up with every missed caller automatically.' },
    body: [{"_type":"callout","_key":"to5kpmdszn","type":"warning","content":"📊 The hard truth: Studies show 78% of customers buy from the first business that responds. If you miss a call and don't follow up within 5 minutes, you have a 10x lower chance of reaching that lead."},{"_type":"block","_key":"zr3xj0tmx8","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"bpp17iln15","text":"What Is Missed Call Text Back?","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"1onf2epjky","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"rvx3llpeke","text":"Missed Call Text Back is a GoHighLevel automation that detects when an inbound call goes unanswered and immediately sends an automated SMS to that caller — usually within 30–60 seconds.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"kry280xw2b","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"0reyay6wvq","text":"Instead of the caller hanging up and calling your competitor, they receive a text that keeps them engaged with your business while you're busy.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"s3enwrmaja","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"oht5owxk2k","text":"Step-by-Step Setup in GoHighLevel","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"em722n56jw","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"f2z1hlwq6p","text":"Step 1: Enable the Feature","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"r0l58gbuyb","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"4emc8jp1e7","text":"Go to ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"qvzxw8smsv","text":"Settings → Business Profile → Missed Call Text Back","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"hhilkt3grt","text":". Toggle it on. You'll see a default message already there — we'll customise this in a moment.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"xp8s2whbw0","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"cgy2ghczny","text":"Step 2: Write Your Message","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"9stqluz3vr","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"klufkmpr2s","text":"The default message is generic. Replace it with something personal and action-oriented. Here's a template that works well:","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"pvybs7rvv3","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"jvk0cg629v","text":"Keep it short, friendly and give them an easy next step. The goal is to keep the conversation going.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"gfo49s4cy5","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"zya8o9ipan","text":"Step 3: Create a Follow-Up Workflow","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"ucuji97s72","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"uft898qooc","text":"The text back is just the start. Build a workflow that continues the conversation if they don't reply:","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"zn5ym114ti","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"listItem":"number","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"zrsdcvkx3d","text":"Trigger: Missed Call","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"0q7lv268oa","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"listItem":"number","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"qsvjtl4h1i","text":"Action 1: Send SMS (immediate)","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"gakpau1eyw","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"listItem":"number","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"6264p4qhcc","text":"Wait: 2 hours","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"crjx4e4pdi","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"listItem":"number","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"bu2oiiv6lh","text":"Condition: If no reply received","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"dho272so65","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"listItem":"number","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"od1834lpnl","text":"Action 2: Send follow-up SMS — \"Just checking in! We have availability this week. Would any of these times work for a quick call?\"","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"o99fjmldnc","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"listItem":"number","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a991grq6g5","text":"Wait: 24 hours","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"tzqk8urw9r","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"listItem":"number","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"zezfsdqzl8","text":"Action 3: Send final email follow-up","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"xtzja9l252","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"v9p3dp1y3x","text":"Step 4: Set Business Hours","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"3q3k5xq1v2","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"bgydm8qtfb","text":"Under ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"zkh65og36t","text":"Settings → Business Hours","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"v3tljk6a2k","text":", set your operating hours. Missed call texts can still go out 24/7, but you can configure different messages for after-hours calls.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"callout","_key":"l83s7bvrtj","type":"tip","content":"💡 After-hours tip: For calls outside business hours, send: \"Thanks for calling! We're closed right now but open again at 9am. Reply here and we'll call you first thing.\""},{"_type":"block","_key":"87o73zds43","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"o1igpixc9v","text":"Real Results From Missed Call Text Back","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"ke7q6j81gq","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"bdrjt7hj24","text":"One of our clients — a local plumbing company — was missing 15–20 calls per week. After setting up missed call text back with a 3-step follow-up sequence, they recovered an average of 8 leads per week that would have been permanently lost.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"mc8mi0gvbk","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"dovuk99vad","text":"At their average job value of $450, that's ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"eboim6szv1","text":"$3,600+ in recovered revenue every week","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"6i6pwqnze5","text":" from a feature that took 20 minutes to set up.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"598ixp478e","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"1g73ci0nbk","text":"Common Mistakes to Avoid","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"0tcd56k258","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"9r2hmovb66","text":"Generic message — \"We'll call you back soon\" doesn't give them a next step","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"jngmcyuep2","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"rf87rpzr9t","text":"No booking link — always include a way for them to take action immediately","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"n0xgls6wu5","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"5p5r3yifp1","text":"Only one message — most leads need 2–3 touchpoints before responding","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"uhxzglpxj6","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"listItem":"bullet","level":1,"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"3xnbaenaso","text":"Wrong timing — make sure your timezone is set correctly in GHL settings","marks":[]}]}],
