    body: [{"_type":"block","_key":"sxsok5aju3","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"5mknv4ijr8","text":"The Problem","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"cqljkay55n","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"hl2ayrhoay","text":"A home services company came to us spending $2,000/month on Facebook ads. They were getting 60–70 leads per month but only closing around 7–8 of them — a 12% close rate that simply wasn't sustainable at that ad spend.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"86rk8q7e95","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"bncxchj7b0","text":"When we asked what happened after a lead came in, the owner said: ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"z8taz83yoh","text":"\"We try to call them the same day, sometimes the next morning if we're busy.\"","marks":["em"]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"3w1pqvsj30","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"uh2v43eeoe","text":"That was the problem. By the time they called, the lead had already spoken to 2–3 competitors who responded faster.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"callout","_key":"ab3bzptevf","type":"warning","content":"The real cost: With an average job value of $380, closing just 5 more leads per month would generate $1,900 in additional revenue — nearly covering the entire ad budget. They were leaving that on the table every single month."},{"_type":"block","_key":"ccx9p0hlsq","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"h9hd8x39t2","text":"What We Built","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"szya9vwl9h","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"8g62mtdm8u","text":"We designed and built a complete GoHighLevel system in 3 weeks:","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"n0de90jjh0","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"4lfwuh9iwf","text":"1. Instant Lead Response (Under 60 Seconds)","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"o3why420cq","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"jarrkv5obe","text":"Every form submission now triggers an immediate automated SMS within 60 seconds. The message is personalised with the lead's name and includes a direct booking link.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"3k68kornu9","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"dt0dypby3w","text":"Simultaneously, an email goes out with a detailed introduction, service overview and a calendar link. The owner gets a notification on his phone so he can jump in the conversation if needed.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"1bjo23zksj","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"21yw4qqd7v","text":"2. AI Chatbot for Lead Qualification","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"1c9w7jaboc","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"mq8zp8j2bv","text":"We built an AI chatbot trained on their specific services, pricing range and service area. When a lead replies to the SMS, the chatbot continues the conversation — asking qualifying questions, handling objections and offering to book a call.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"jsmz2h6n4p","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ui2wj0kr3n","text":"The chatbot handles about 60% of conversations completely autonomously, booking appointments without any human involvement.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"w4rmhhcmgw","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"dpn0mjm5bn","text":"3. 7-Day Follow-Up Sequence","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"fs5k73obnf","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"s1xvnawma0","text":"For leads that don't book immediately, a 7-day follow-up sequence runs automatically:","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"9puh6tsjoe","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"ly3zh1mkp5","text":"Day 1: Immediate SMS + email","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"5b9sbhvd8f","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"4hehvwqxcz","text":"Day 1 (2 hours later): Follow-up SMS if no reply","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"64gf7to3t9","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"jqv1fuz6a1","text":"Day 2: Educational email about the service","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"ercfon8oeo","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"x5z408z3v1","text":"Day 4: SMS with a special offer","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"fqomu7qz9h","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"keuec4zzxt","text":"Day 7: Final \"closing\" email","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"cfhldylcfy","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"a709lgpxil","text":"4. Missed Call Text Back","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"j6cpxda7v5","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"45b1wc7cm1","text":"Any missed inbound call now gets an automatic text within 30 seconds. This alone recovered an estimated 8–10 leads per month that were previously lost completely.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"qcrx3dn9fk","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"amh59rsrxz","text":"5. Pipeline & CRM Setup","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"msgpmlrxmt","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"gcjsrbvz1a","text":"We built a 7-stage pipeline with automated stage movements. When a lead books a call, they move to the \"Appointment Booked\" stage automatically. When the call is completed, a one-click button moves them to \"Quote Sent\" and triggers the quote follow-up sequence.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"5o4oo98vnp","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"x8vy32r8b2","text":"The Results (After 30 Days)","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"resultsTable","_key":"i3zj04f86c","rows":[{"metric":"Close Rate","before":"12%","after":"28%"},{"metric":"Lead Response Time","before":"6–24 hours","after":"Under 60 seconds"},{"metric":"Appointments Booked","before":"8/month","after":"22/month"},{"metric":"Monthly Revenue","before":"~$3,040","after":"~$8,360"},{"metric":"Manual Follow-Up Time","before":"2–3 hrs/day","after":"Near zero"}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"73jzf0ax2t","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"hzluntfqrv","text":"Key Takeaway","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"d4wpjx2xts","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"8xqv69ceb8","text":"The ad spend didn't change. The service didn't change. The only thing that changed was ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"4856qhru90","text":"how fast and how consistently leads were followed up with","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"an16plv4ar","text":". That single change more than doubled monthly revenue from the same marketing budget.","marks":[]}]}],
